### 54.6. CURRENT AFFAIRS LINKAGE (2023-2026)
| Issue | Linkage | Mains Angle |
|---|---|---|
| Demand for special status/category for other regions | Art 371 model vs separate statehood | Asymmetric federalism, resource allocation |
| Implementation of Art 371J in Karnataka | Development board, local reservations | Regional equity, backwardness |
| Tribal rights & land issues in NE states | Art 371A/G protections | Autonomy vs integration, customary law |
| Inter-regional disparities | Development boards mechanism | Cooperative federalism, targeted interventions |

